<h2 id="questionnaire">Questionnaire</h2>


<p class="italic">Please fill out <a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScponQw_r_7dy54jTzd0o-XRzqv2hy44bwm7kSnM3FNR3qZJw/viewform">this Google Form</a> to submit your Questionnaire. Other formats will not be accepted.</p>

<p><em>Candidate Details:</em>
<ol>
	<li>Name:</li>
	<li>Pronouns:</li>
	<li>Seat Declaring Candidacy For:</li>
	<ol type="a">
		<li>If incumbent, please list how long you have held the seat for:</li>
	</ol>
	<li>Campaign Related Email Address:</li>
	<li>Link to Candidate Website (if exists):</li>
	<li>Link to Official Office Website (if in office):</li>
	<li>Please list all of the following if applicable:</li>
		<ol type="a">
		<li>Previous elected offices you have held and the years in office?</li>
		<li>Any other elections in which you have run as a candidate, and in which years?</li>
	</ol>
	<li>Occupation (how do you sell your labor to avoid poverty?):</li>
	<li>Are you in a Union? If so, name and local?:</li>
	<li>Are you a DSA Member? If so, how long have you been a member?:</li>
</ol>
</p>

<p><em>Campaign</em>
<ol>
	<li>What endorsements have you received so far? What do you see as your path to victory?</li>
	<li>Do you commit to not to take any campaign contributions from real estate developers, big landlords and corporate lobbyists? (Y/N)</li>
	<li>Do you commit to rejecting any political endorsement or campaign contributions by labor groups whose mission is primarily to organize and represent police officers? (Y/N)</li>
	<li>Will you endorse other candidates that Bloomington IN DSA democratically votes to endorse? (Y/N)</li>
</ol>
</p>

<p><em>Socialism</em>
<ol>
	<li>Will you publicly identify as a democratic socialist in your campaign? (Y/N)</li>
	<li>Will you urge supporters to join DSA to help build an alternative to politics as usual? (Y/N)</li>
	<li>Will you critique the corporate influence in democratic politics in your campaign? (Y/N)</li>
	<li>Describe your plan for engaging with multiracial, working-class communities and give working people the opportunity to weigh in on policy decisions and direction:</li>
	<li>Describe a specific policy you want to implement, to build power for the working class:</li>
	<li>What does Democratic Socialism mean to you:</li>
</ol>
</p>

<p><em>Social Housing (BDSA 2025 Chapter Priority)</em>
<ol>
	<li>Do you support an immediate halt to encampment sweeps and fully funding a housing first approach to end homelessness? (Y/N)</li>
	<li>Do you support the preservation of public housing and expansion by building thousands of additional public housing units over 10 years? (Y/N)</li>
	<li>Describe a specific policy you want to implement to prevent capitalist speculation and profiteering of housing:</li>
	<li>Describe a specific policy you want to implement to improve housing affordability: </li>
</ol>
</p>


<p><em>Protecting Rights and Freedoms</em>
<ol>
	<li>Describe a specific policy you want to implement to rectify the legacy of white supremacy, provide reparations for Black and Indigenous communities, and dismantle the structures which enable it:</li>
	<li>Describe a specific policy you want to implement to aid and protect people with disabilities:</li>
	<li>What will you do to support LGBTQ+ rights and fight discrimination, violence, and oppression against LGBTQ+ people, especially as it relates to the trans community?</li>
</ol>
</p>


<p><em>Support for Immigrants</em>
<ol>
	<li>Describe a specific policy you want to implement to support immigrants, both documented and undocumented, and their families:</li>
</ol>
</p>

<p><em>Palestine Solidarity</em>
<ol>
	<li>Have you publicly called for an immediate ceasefire and arms embargo in response to the genocidal actions taken by the state of Israel? (Y/N)</li>
	<li>Do you support Boycott, Divestment, and Sanctions (BDS) for companies complicit in the genocide in Palestine? (Y/N)</li>
	<li>Do you oppose efforts that penalize/criminalize people that boycott Israel, and the use of force against protesters? (Y/N)</li>
	<li>Do you pledge to refrain from any and all affiliation with the Israeli government or Zionist lobby groups? (Y/N)</li>
</ol>
</p>


<p><em>Police &amp; Incarceration</em>
<ol>
	<li>Do you support efforts to demilitarize police forces? (Y/N)</li>
	<li>Do you oppose increases to the current police budget? (Y/N)</li>
	<li>Do you oppose the jail expansion/new jail? (Y/N)</li>
	<li>Describe a specific policy you want to implement that would expand public safety alternatives to police departments, such as unarmed traffic enforcement or restorative programs:</li>
	<li>Describe a specific policy you want to implement to reduce mass incarceration:</li>
</ol>
</p>

<p><em>Ending the Military-Industrial Complex</em>
<ol>
	<li>Do you oppose publicly-funded economic incentives for companies involved in military technology, surveillance, and defense contracts? (Y/N)</li>
	<li>Will you work to cancel the city’s contracts with surveillance companies? (Y/N)</li>
	<li>Describe a specific policy you want to implement to protect our citizens from surveillance, or to prevent public funding from going to the military-industrial complex:</li>
</ol>
</p>
